      en: ["Inaugurated on October 28, 1895", "Designed by Juan Hurtado Manrique", "Height of approximately 22 meters", "Commemorates the Federal War (1859-1863)", "Inspired by the Arc de Triomphe in Paris", "Serves as the gateway to El Calvario Park"],
